stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_list_leaders: JOIN team_leaders, teams, members
    q_list_leaders --> q_check_filter: discord_uid parameter provided?
    q_check_filter --> q_return_all: no - return all team leaders
    q_check_filter --> q_filter_uid: yes - WHERE discord_uid = input
    q_filter_uid --> q_left_join_leader: LEFT JOIN team_leaders on member_id
    q_left_join_leader --> q_case_check: CASE WHEN tl.member_id IS NOT NULL
    q_case_check --> q_is_leader: member is team leader
    q_case_check --> q_not_leader: member is not team leader
    q_is_leader --> [*]: return (discord_uid, team_name, leader_status)
    q_not_leader --> [*]: return (discord_uid, NULL, not_leader)
    q_return_all --> [*]: return all leaders ORDER BY team name

    note right of q_filter_uid
        INV-001: User-supplied discord_uid in WHERE clause
        INV-002: Leader status derivable for any member by querying their discord_uid
        INV-003: LEFT JOIN ensures result even if member is not a leader
